## Test Results

**61 / 61 tests passed** in 2.66 seconds.

Test coverage:
- ✅ Log parsing (error counting, pattern detection, severity classification)
- ✅ File validation (extension, size, encoding)
- ✅ Database CRUD (save, retrieve, search, filter, embeddings)
- ✅ All REST API endpoints (`/analyze`, `/incidents`, `/incidents/<id>`, `/health`, `/download`)
- ✅ All 6 sample log file scenarios
- ✅ AI engine fallback behavior (reports work without AI models)

