## AI Models Status

The AI models (`transformers`, `sentence-transformers`) are **not yet installed** in the venv — this is expected. The app fully functions in **Rule-based mode**. 

To enable AI-generated reports:

```powershell
cd "d:\MYOWNPROJECTS\Incident investigator\backend"
.\venv\Scripts\activate
pip install transformers torch sentence-transformers accelerate
```

After installation, restart `python app.py`. Models download automatically (~390 MB) on first analysis request.

