| File | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `backend/app.py` | Flask REST API |
| `backend/log_analyzer.py` | Rule-based log parser |
| `backend/ai_engine.py` | FLAN-T5 + fallback report generator |
| `backend/incident_search.py` | MiniLM similarity search |
| `backend/database.py` | SQLite schema and queries |
| `backend/requirements.txt` | Python dependencies |
| `frontend/index.html` | Single-page app |
| `frontend/style.css` | Dark developer theme |
| `frontend/script.js` | Vanilla JS SPA logic |
| `sample_logs/*.log` | 6 test scenarios |
| `tests/test_app.py` | pytest suite (61 tests) |
| `README.md` | Full documentation |
